WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:03,820
Miss Chen

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,280
The illness just started to go uphill

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:06,400
Not afraid of getting sick again

4
00:00:07,630 --> 00:00:10,990
It's strange that I'm here to talk formally.

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:14,980
What can happen to this island officially from now on?

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:16,380
I have the final say over the camp.

7
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:17,900
I will rearrange the worksheet

8
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,820
Continue to arrange for people to come and help you with your work.

9
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,220
You only use equal exchange, fair trade

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,940
Don't worry about anything else.

11
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:26,740
When will it be your turn to have the final say, Su Weiwei?

12
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,260
This is not your business

13
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:29,790
Negotiate business again

14
00:00:29,990 --> 00:00:34,380
You just have to tell me if you want to tell me what benefits you want.

15
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:35,620
I want you to say something

16
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,220
Things to do with money in the future

17
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:38,900
Do you accept the rules I set?

18
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:40,780
As long as your rules don't hinder me

19
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,220
I don't have to make love to you

20
00:00:43,700 --> 00:00:44,820
My rules are simple

21
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:46,740
Who works and who reaps

22
00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,740
Same thing, never think twice

23
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:50,100
In order to show sincerity in cooperation

24
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,060
I'll do the first day's work myself

25
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,900
No remuneration is required from you

26
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,900
Miss Chen is still a fair person

27
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:57,580
Since you are so sincere

28
00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:58,900
Then I have to measure it

29
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,820
Teacher Jiang’s speech also confirms something

30
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:02,260
You can also send someone there

31
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:06,570
Thank you for the salt and immersion water. What are you going to do today?

32
00:01:06,810 --> 00:01:07,890
I'm ready to get started
